WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:01.680
Yuya...

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.670
Ute is inside of you.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.750
He lives on.

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.220
Ute is inside me?

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.790
Now, I can have hope.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:14.310
Whether what's in that core is Ray or Yuzu,

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:17.500
I think Ruri may be alive inside her.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.800
I'll save Yuzu. And Ruri, too!

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.180
Don't get cocky!

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:33.290
Coward that you are right now, 
you cannot save a single person!

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:40.150
Implementing mass into Solid Vision 
has created Action Duels.

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:45.130
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:48.180
the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:26.990
Dimension Highway

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:31.400
Who's he?

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.230
Jack Atlas.

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:36.220
He fought with Yuya in the Synchro Dimension,

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:40.110
and helped us during the battle 
with Z-ARC. He's an ally.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:41.510
I see.

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:42.400
So this, too,

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.810
is just as you planned it.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.680
Yuya is a coward?

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:49.460
Why would he say that?

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:52.520
I'll admit, I did find it strange.

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:58.860
He had two Level 4 monsters out, but he 
didn't summon Dark Rebellion.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:02.830
It's because he's afraid of his dragons!

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:06.520
That deck should contain the 
four dragons Z-ARC used

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.570
as components for the Supreme King!

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:13.310
You're afraid that when you 
summon them, you'll fuse again!

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:17.240
That's why you won't bring more 
than one dragon onto the field!

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.940
I...

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:21.520
No matter how fierce the monster,

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:25.420
if you cannot bend it to your will, 
you are a failure as a duelist!

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:27.390
But... I'm doing this for Layra!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:32.560
If I summon all the dragons, the Z-ARC 
sealed inside Layra might awaken.

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:35.030
This time, Layra would be that devil!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.740
So I want to find another way...

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:41.530
I want to fight the most entertaining 
duel I can to make Layra smile,

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.300
without using dragons!

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:46.910
If you're trying to accomplish 
something, do not falter!

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:53.310
If you truly wish to save Layra, fight me.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:56.780
Use the four dragons and all of your power!

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.270
With you, Jack?

00:03:58.270 --> 00:03:59.190
But...

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.470
I have no objections to this.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:02.490
Reiji!

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:07.350
You tried to retrieve Layra's smile by 
using your entertainment duels.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:12.200
If she, who lost her smile after taking 
Z-ARC in, were to smile again,

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:16.900
it would signify the purification 
of Z-ARC's evil soul.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:21.200
But I'm afraid that your battles 
with Dennis and Kurosaki

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:22.940
did not return Layra's smile.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.790
Thus, we cannot turn back now.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:32.150
With your dueling, you must purge 
Z-ARC's threat forever.

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:34.960
I will do everything I can 
to achieve that, as well.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:38.120
I have prepared a special 
stage for you and Jack.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:41.360
It's a riding course that 
links all four dimensions.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.720
I call it the Dimension Highway.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:10.820
I want you to show people in all the 
dimensions the ultimate riding duel.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:14.170
And this time, make Layra smile.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.040
But I don't have—

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.530
A D-Wheel? Yes, you do!

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.530
Crow!

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:25.200
I brought the D-Wheel you 
used in the Friendship Cup!

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:27.670
A suit and a helmet, too!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.880
I envy you, to be honest.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.580
Getting to fight a riding duel on 
such an incredible course...

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:40.320
Old man Tokumatsu and the kids 
are all looking forward to it.

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:41.150
Do your best.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.600
They're looking forward to it?

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.410
You mean...

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:48.540
No one's ever seen or attempted it.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:52.330
And the one bringing you this legendary, 
dimension-spanning battle is...

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:55.680
The same commentator from 
the Friendship Cup...

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:59.580
Me, Melissa Claire, of course!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:01.210
Now, let's go.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.770
Everyone ready?

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:04.740
Yeah!

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:12.280
So Reiji knew this would happen, 
and he planned it all.

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:16.990
Action Field, on.

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:18.990
Crossover Acceleration!

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:22.960
Duel Mode, on. Autopilot, stand by.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:27.750
But it's true that I haven't been 
able to make Layra smile.

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:32.640
I haven't saved Yuzu, Ruri, 
or the others yet, either.

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:34.590
I've just gotta do it.

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:38.220
Earnestly fight the duel I believe in, 
in my own way.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:43.580
If you truly wish to save Layra, fight me.

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:47.050
Use the four dragons and all of your power!

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:52.170
Riding duel... Acceleration!

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:54.060
Duel!

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:57.990
I take the first turn!

00:06:57.990 --> 00:07:00.960
When there are no monsters on my field,

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:04.140
I can Special Summon Red 
Gargoyle from my hand.

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:13.820
And I summon my Tuner Monster, Red Resonator.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:19.400
In that instant, Red Gargoyle's 
monster effect activates.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:23.000
I double Red Resonator's level.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:29.960
The now-Level 4 Red Resonator 
tunes Level 4 Red Gargoyle.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:34.380
The cry of the champion 
shakes heaven and earth.

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:37.980
Let the conqueror's unique power 
be carved into your body!

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.100
Synchro Summon.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.740
The raging soul...

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:44.570
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:52.510
He got right to it! Jack's ace monster!

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:54.380
He doesn't miss a beat, does he?

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:56.790
He's going full throttle, 
right out of the gate!

00:07:56.790 --> 00:08:00.090
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:01.260 --> 00:08:03.430
Now, it's your turn, Yuya!

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:05.230
Bring out your dragons!

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:07.700
My turn!

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:10.480
I set the Pendulum Scale with 
Scale 1 Stargazer Magician

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:15.180
and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:24.580
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and Level 7 simultaneously!

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:27.540
Pendulum Summon!

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:33.780
Appear, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:37.030
Performapal Coin Dragon!

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:41.430
Performapal Odd-Eyes Minitaurus!

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:46.110
Yuya has two Level 4 monsters on his field!

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:47.540
This means, of course...

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.960
Aw, they left?

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.340
And we were just getting to the good part...

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.440
What are you doing, Yuya?

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:57.050
Xyz Summon your dragon already!

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:01.750
I told you to use all four dragons. 
Have you forgotten that?

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.750
I haven't forgotten!

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:04.960
But...

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.720
I feel it.

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:09.060
Dark Rebellion wants to come out.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:11.660
So do Clear Wing and Starving Venom.

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:15.630
Do they want to come out, 
so they can reawaken Z-ARC?

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:19.370
I know... I was Z-ARC, so I know.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:23.070
I won't allow Layra to become Z-ARC... 
To become a devil!

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:26.810
I will find a path to victory, without summoning dragons!

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:31.480
Yuya's coming!

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:41.260
Now, show these children the 
ultimate in entertainment!

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:43.960
In that instant, I activate 
Coin Dragon's effect,

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:48.930
and raise the attack points of all Dragon-Type 
Monsters on my field by 500!

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:50.120
Battle!

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:55.800
I attack Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend 
with Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:59.360
In that instant, Odd-Eyes Minitaurus's effect

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:02.120
reduces Scarlight's attack points by 300!

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:10.820
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:14.620
I activate my trap Red Gem.

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:18.620
This turn, Red Monsters can't be destroyed!

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:20.970
But you still take damage!

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.520
Reaction Force...

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.000
The damage is doubled!

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:32.740
In that instant, Minitaurus's effect ends,

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:35.530
and Scarlight's attack 
points return to normal.

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:40.180
Now, I end my turn!

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:42.890
Fight hard, Yuya!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:47.090
You think I will be satisfied 
with a such a duel?

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:49.290
My turn!

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.130
I activate Scarlight's effect.

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:57.050
I destroy all Special Summoned monsters with 
fewer attack points than those of Scarlight,

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.970
and for each, I deal you 
500 points of damage!

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:03.410
Absolute Power Flame!

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:05.850
I activate Coin Dragon's effect!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:10.170
Dragon-Type Monsters on my field 
can't be destroyed by effects!

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:18.440
Battle.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:22.890
Scarlight, destroy that eyesore, 
Coin Dragon, as well!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:26.860
Red Hot Crimson Hell Burning!

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:37.820
In that instant, Coin Dragon's effect ends,

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:41.190
and Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon's 
attack points return to normal.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.330
I now end my turn.

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:47.250
Yuya, I will give you one more chance.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.920
This time, bring out all 
four of your dragons!

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.720
I just told you, I can't!

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:54.720
Not just Layra...

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:59.910
If I summon all the dragons and Ray, 
who Leo Akaba's trying to save...

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:03.750
with Yuzu, Ruri, and the others, 
something bad might happen to them!

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:11.080
That's what I think... So...

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:22.620
My turn!

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:29.030
I use the Pendulum Scale already 
set to Pendulum Summon!

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:32.030
Be reborn from my Extra Deck!

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:34.300
Performapal Coin Dragon!

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:37.750
And Performapal Odd-Eyes Minitaurus!

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:39.640
Yuya...

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:49.920
Jack keeps ordering Yuya to 
summon his four dragons!

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:52.250
Well, Yuya? What will you do?

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:57.660
I use Coin Dragon's effect to increase 
Dragon-Type Monsters' attack points by 500!

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:03.230
Battle! I attack Scarlight 
Red Dragon Archfiend

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:05.930
with Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:11.040
In that instant, Minitaurus's effect reduces 
Scarlight's attack points by 300!

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:17.210
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:18.910
The same trick again?

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:20.910
Action Spell Evasion,

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:22.380
I negate the attack!

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:23.900
No, you won't!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.580
I activate Stargazer Magician's 
Pendulum Effect!

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:32.940
I negate the activation of a spell card, 
and set it on your field!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.290
Not so fast!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.700
When a spell card is set on my field,

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.130
I can Special Summon Red Giant from my hand.

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:48.790
And I activate Red Giant's effect to 
force an end to the Battle Phase.

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:52.240
I end my turn.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.280
It's good that Stargazer Magician's 
Pendulum Effect

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:59.390
negated the Action Spell Jack was activating.

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:02.750
But to use that to summon another monster...

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.220
Jack really is something.

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:07.920
But if he'd just summoned Dark Rebellion...

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:12.600
I wanna see Yuya's dragon lineup 
again and get the shivers!

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:13.560
No!

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:15.470
If he does that, then Layra...

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.990
Not just Layra, but Yuzu, too.

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:21.920
He thinks if he summons all four dragons,

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:25.310
it might become impossible to save Yuzu.

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:26.410
But is that really true?

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:28.600
He never changes.

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:30.390
Yoko?

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:36.220
Don't be a scaredy cat, Yuya!

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:38.860
A duelist should bring out what he needs,

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:41.360
whether it's dragons or anything else!

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:44.880
Did I say something else I shouldn't have?

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:48.100
Oh, I'm so embarrassed!

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.300
Shooting Star Yoko...

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.270
You've disappointed me, Yuya!

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:55.900
If you refuse to bring out your four dragons,

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:58.330
then there's no point left in us fighting!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.910
I'll crush you on this turn!

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:03.880
I activate my spell card Red Reborn,

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:07.120
and Special Summon Red 
Gargoyle from my graveyard.

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:14.890
I also summon Tuner Monster Double Resonator!

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:21.330
And for this turn, Double Resonator's effect 
lets me use Red Giant as a Tuner Monster.

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:25.600
Level 5 Red Giant and 
Level 1 Double Resonator

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:29.450
Double Tune Level 4 Red Gargoyle!

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:32.740
Listen to the cry of my soul!

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:36.210
Do you feel it? The exhilaration of my life!

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:39.180
Champion and demon, merge here and now!

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:41.630
Touch the red dragon's soul

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:44.090
and raise the cry that creates 
heaven and earth!

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:45.820
Synchro Summon.

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:50.160
Appear, Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:15:57.710 --> 00:15:58.800
Battle!

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:01.910
Tyrant attacks Coin Dragon.

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:04.720
Inferno Crimson Hell Tide!

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:12.320
Yuya!

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:15.360
Coin Dragon's destruction

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:19.160
returns Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon's attack points to normal.

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:22.360
Now, for Minitaurus.

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:24.500
Go... Battle, Scarlight.

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:28.810
The difference between Scarlight and 
Minitaurus is 1800 attack points!

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:31.200
Yuya has 1400 life remaining!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:33.170
If this attack goes through...

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.410
...Yuya loses.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:37.740
Red Hot Crimson Hell Burning!

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.880
Are you willing to lose like this?

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:48.330
That voice... Ute?

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:51.950
I don't like it. 
Neither does my Starving Venom.

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.680
Or my Clear Wing.

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:55.420
Or my Dark Rebellion.

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:57.800
I'm sure that's how they feel.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:59.560
Joeri? Hugo, too?

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:03.600
I wonder why you won't try to 
understand the dragons' feelings.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:06.140
Why do you ignore them?

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:09.210
Listen to their voices, Yuya.

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:12.180
We should be able to do that!

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:17.690
By negating destruction by battle,

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:21.650
I Special Summon Performapal 
Odd-Eyes Dissolver!

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:29.560
Odd-Eyes Dissolver can negate 
one monster's effect!

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:36.230
Odd-Eyes Dissolver negates the effect 
of Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:38.650
You made a poor choice, Yuya.

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:44.250
Scarlight can destroy all Special Summoned 
monsters with fewer attack points,

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.710
and deal 500 damage to you for each. 
Have you forgotten?

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.930
You'll take a total of 1500 damage, 
and then you'll be finished!

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:57.480
On the turn Odd-Eyes Dissolver is Special 
Summoned, it can't be destroyed!

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.730
Hanging on by a thread, eh?

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:08.270
I set one card and end my turn!

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:11.900
Ute. Hugo. Joeri.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:14.230
That's right...

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:15.670
We were one person, to begin with.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:18.560
Even if the evil soul is gone,

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:21.110
as one who holds all his 
copies within himself...

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.640
I am the real Z-ARC.

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:27.650
Z-ARC was capable of 
communicating with his monsters!

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:30.620
My turn!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:37.370
I use the Pendulum Scale already 
set, to Pendulum Summon!

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:44.780
Be reborn from my Extra Deck, 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:47.640
Performapal Coin Dragon!

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.710
Performapal Odd-Eyes Minitaurus!

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:55.150
You still don't understand, Yuya?

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.970
I do understand!

00:18:56.970 --> 00:19:02.620
You're telling me not to be a master who 
will flinch, having once been bitten.

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:05.820
That's right! Show it to me...

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:11.100
Your power as master of 
the four raging dragons!

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:14.570
I'll show you, Jack... Our power!

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:18.160
Sorry to make you wait, Ute.

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.270
I'll start with you!

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:30.460
I overlay Level 4 Performapal Coin Dragon 
and Performapal Odd-Eyes Minitaurus!

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:36.820
From the black darkness,

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:40.820
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:42.560
Xyz Summon!

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:47.730
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:52.800
There it is!

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:54.340
Ute's dragon!

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:55.450
Yes...

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:56.860
Keep it up, Yuya!

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.560
Layra!

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.090
The evil soul is resonating.

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:11.690
The souls of the dragons 
and Z-ARC really are...

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:19.100
I also summon Tuner Monster 
Odd-Eyes Synchron from my hand!

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:24.100
Next up, Hugo!

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:27.070
In the Pendulum Zone,

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:30.360
Performapal Odd-Eyes Synchron 
can use itself and a card

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:32.280
as components to Synchro Summon!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:38.860
Level 2 Odd-Eyes Synchron tunes 
Level 5 Stargazer Magician!

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:45.320
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings, 
to strike the enemy at the speed of light!

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.930
Synchro Summon!

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:51.640
Appear, Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:00.570
And last, Joeri!

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:04.080
I activate Performapal Odd-Eyes 
Dissolver's effect,

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:08.510
to fuse Timegazer Magician 
with it, in my Pendulum Zone!

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:11.200
Different-colored eyes that 
illuminate the darkness,

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:14.790
become the compass of time, 
and show the way to a new path!

00:21:15.490 --> 00:21:17.220
Fusion Summon!

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:21.270
Appear, Starving Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:31.100
Please stop this...

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:33.660
She needs to endure this.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:38.070
Because the real fun is only getting started.

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:57.130
These aren't voices of anger.

00:21:57.540 --> 00:21:59.560
They're afraid of Ray...

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:03.070
That's why they want to 
prevent her resurrection.

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:05.330
Don't be afraid!

00:22:05.330 --> 00:22:08.520
You can be strong, even without 
being the Supreme King!

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:11.850
I'll prove that to you!

00:23:49.140 --> 00:23:51.900
Now, show me, Yuya...

00:23:51.900 --> 00:23:54.750
The entertainment you believe in!

00:23:54.750 --> 00:23:56.910
I won't let the dragons 
become the Supreme King.

00:23:57.280 --> 00:24:02.190
I'll show them that power doesn't exist 
to hurt people or to destroy the world.

00:24:02.770 --> 00:24:04.600
It exists to protect people's smiles.

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:05.800
I swear it!

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:07.260
Come, with everything you've got.

00:24:07.260 --> 00:24:10.790
Show me, through battle, 
those four dragons' power!

00:24:11.530 --> 00:24:15.180
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Dragons Unleashed.

00:24:15.180 --> 00:24:17.260
The fun is only getting started!
